      "briefTitle": "A Study to Investigate Efficacy, Safety and Tolerability of Barzolvolimab Versus Placebo in Adults With Cold Induced Urticaria and Symptomatic Dermographism Inadequately Controlled by H1-antihistamines (EMBARQ - ColdU and SD)",
      "officialTitle": "A Phase 3 Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Multi-Center, Parallel-Group Study of Barzolvolimab in Participants With Cold Induced Urticaria and Symptomatic Dermographism (EMBARQ-COLDU and SD)"
